WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.440
Incident on a Rainy Day

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:09.920
Oh?

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.070
So you and Ruru-san were both 
at your grandmother's place.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.790
Yeah, to help pick corn.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:23.270
But it's quite the coincidence that 
all three of you ran into Rurumo.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:23.830
Yeah.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.080
I ran into her on the street.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.700
I saw her on the train.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.320
I just passed by her while 
jogging with my club...

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:36.010
I'd only ever seen her wearing a coverall 
apron, so I was surprised at first.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.850
But in its own way...

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:41.100
That was pretty cute!

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.400
Later.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:59.450
<b>Adult Gravure</b>

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:56.850
Seriously?

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.450
These are <i>Adult Gravure</i> magazines!

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:03.660
Is God willing me to add 
these to the Shibaki library?

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:08.080
Thank you!

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.860
<i>What is this piercing gaze I feel?</i>

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.600
Hey, isn't that Shibaki-san the pervert?

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.630
What is he doing?

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:19.300
<i>This sucks...</i>

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:22.560
<i>Depending on how I handle this situation,</i>

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:27.230
<i>my new nickname might be Mr. Pick-up Porn!</i>

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:36.740
Aww, what pitiful little kittens!

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.760
Shibaki-senpai...

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.200
He might actually be a nice person.

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:44.950
<i>That was close.</i>

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.710
Thanks for the help.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:53.550
You guys don't have a home, do you?

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.200
Wanna come to my place?

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.480
<b>The Thriller Express
The Manslaughter Case from Hell</b>

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:37.110
Ya have a favor to ask me?

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:42.530
Yeah, but you would never hear me out.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:45.620
Rurumo would, but you...

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.460
Why are ya beatin' around the bush?

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.450
If you've got a favor to ask, man up and ask!

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:52.060
Pretend...

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.670
these kittens are yours!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.710
What? What are ya talkin' about?

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.030
Look, here's Mommy.

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:02.230
Hey! Don't lie to 'em!

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:03.930
Don't suck on me!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.390
I'm not yer mom! My body's still pure!

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:10.720
What are ya making me say, idiot?

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:16.670
Oh, right. You must be hungry.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.190
Wait here.

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:22.960
A little more...

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.950
Ya bought kitten formula for 'em?

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:29.740
It was in that box.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:33.000
Please adopt them. 
I'm sorry.

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:35.240
How sad...

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.710
Okay, it's body temperature now.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:41.300
Here, drink up.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.880
You like it? Good.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.500
I'm surprised ya can understand 'em.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.060
You're a cat, but you can't speak cat?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:55.420
I only understand human speech.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.900
That's why I can't be their mother.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.890
Can't you do something about that?

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.440
You like these, don't you?

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:07.160
<b>Mackerel</b>

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:04.530
Are ya tryin' to bribe me?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.100
I won't fall fer that.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:10.370
I came to return the book I borrowed.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.330
Aren't they cute?

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.700
What's wrong? Identify yourselves.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:28.180
Whose familiars are you?

00:05:29.080 --> 00:05:30.160
Why don't they speak?

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:32.720
Earth cats don't talk.

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:34.790
How strange.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.240
If they don't identify themselves, 
I won't know their names.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:40.350
Their owners name them.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.660
I know! Let's name them!

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:44.620
Chiro.

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.280
Who, me?

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:51.030
One, Two, Three?

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.770
You suck at naming!

00:05:52.770 --> 00:05:55.580
I never said I wanted to name 'em!

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:59.210
Man, Slaughter, Case.

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:00.960
Manslaughter case?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.920
<b>The Thriller Express
The Manslaughter Case from Hell</b>

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:03.380
Whoa, now.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.920
That book's influenced you too much.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:08.210
Why do the people in this keep dying?

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:10.550
That's how mysteries work.

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:18.580
Are you guys okay with 
Man, Slaughter, and Case?

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.020
That settles that, then.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.740
Okay, okay, good kitties...

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.910
Case is just like you.

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:36.970
I haven't been tripping as often lately.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.900
And that's just like you, too.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:45.200
All right!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.510
If he couldn't stand, that'd be the real "case."

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.800
The problem is my mom.

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.740
Huh?

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:55.560
You aside, my mom hates animals.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:56.930
Right?

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.770
<i>Stare...</i>

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:15.990
What should I do with them until 
I can find homes for them?

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.380
I can't keep them at my place anymore...

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.400
The world is full of dangers.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:28.840
What about keeping them at school?

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.090
Nice idea, Rurumo!

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.350
I'll start looking tomorrow.

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:38.470
For today, behave yourselves here.

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:45.480
Is there anyone who can adopt a cat?

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:49.930
I'm looking for people who love cats 
and will take good care of them!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:53.030
You said you like cats, right? 
What do you say?

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.700
I live in an apartment...

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:56.690
You live in a house, right?

00:07:56.690 --> 00:07:59.130
My little sister has a hamster...

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:00.310
A cat, huh?

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:02.230
I want one almost as much 
as a younger sister,

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:04.920
but our apartment doesn't allow pets...

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:08.930
He hardly ever gets so passionate 
about anything other than girls.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:11.670
Yeah. Usually...

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:14.760
<i>Man, summer uniforms are great! They're so thin!</i>

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.750
...he'd be saying something like that.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:18.340
Hey, isn't your place...

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.560
How cute!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.920
Aren't they?

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:25.030
Do you know anyone who'd like to adopt a cat?

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.770
I'll ask around my class.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.800
That'd be a big help, Tanako-chan.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:30.710
You, too, guys.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.030
Senpai, you're...

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:35.540
not interested in cats, are you?

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:36.030
No.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.030
However, I would immediately adopt a cat

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:41.250
if it spoke or had some kind of mysterious power.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:45.830
<b>Tray Return</b>

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.960
It's starting to rain.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.700
I'd better make this warmer.

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:05.570
I cooled it to body temperature.

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:06.310
Thanks.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:12.460
Okay. Drink up.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:15.860
In a hurry, aren't you?

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:20.330
Drink lots and grow up big.

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:23.790
Do you like cats that much?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.040
Do they taste good?

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.120
Don't ask that so awkwardly!

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:34.960
They're so cute. I couldn't eat them.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.620
Do you like them because they're cute?

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.430
Well, of course, there's that, too.

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.310
Here!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.000
Case, over here.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:56.980
My parents never let me keep pets.

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:02.280
I always wanted to have something 
grow attached to me like this.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.600
Don't climb on my face, Slaughter!

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:08.500
I said stop that! Come on!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.800
<i>Why am I in such a good mood?</i>

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:15.810
What are ya dancin' for?

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:17.370
Hey, Chiro.

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:18.210
What's up?

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:19.800
What's wrong with me bein' here?

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:23.750
The cafeteria ladies will chase 
you off again if they find you.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:25.760
Oh, I know.

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:28.880
Did you come to check on these guys 
because you were worried about them?

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:29.810
No!

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.190
I just dropped in to see ya 'cause 
I was walkin' past the school.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:34.360
I see, I see.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.980
So, how'd it go?

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:38.850
Think you'll find homes for 'em?

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.640
I reached out to a bunch of people.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.240
I'll probably find someone.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.490
Trainee!

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:46.350
They're calling me. I'm going now.

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.830
I've got class, so I've gotta go, too.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.270
Take care of them, Chiro.

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:54.250
Huh? Wait!

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:56.710
What am I supposed to do by myself?

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:58.850
Wait, ya idiot!

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.230
How irresponsible.

00:11:01.230 --> 00:11:04.430
How am I supposed to take care of 'em?

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.390
I told ya not to do that!

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:08.850
Here.

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:12.680
It's not good fer ya to eat so quickly.

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.820
Drink slowly. Slowly.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:18.280
Yer a mess.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:31.690
The rain isn't letting up at all.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.710
What's wrong, Case?

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.130
<b>You</b>

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:41.130
<b>Dropped</b>

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.130
<b>This</b>

00:11:39.980 --> 00:11:41.130
The tickets!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:46.050
You're so nice, you know that?!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:50.310
You'll find a home in no time! Good kitty!

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.990
I was just like these guys...

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:58.820
Rurumo took me in...

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.590
For the most part,

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:07.370
only cats with good pedigrees 
can be familiars to witches.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:13.830
<i>Chiro-chan, I'm going to work for 
a witch in the Mashdolt family.</i>

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.990
<i>I hope you find a master soon, too.</i>

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:19.920
<i>That's impossible.</i>

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:22.880
<i>She's a stray of unknown origins.</i>

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:27.670
I was always alone.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:30.840
I thought I'd always be alone...

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:39.410
<i>Need a magic wand? They're handmade.</i>

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:41.160
<i>They're cheap.</i>

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:42.350
<i>How filthy.</i>

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:43.230
<i>Lame.</i>

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:44.530
<i>Is she really trying to sell those?</i>

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:50.060
<i>I would like one.</i>

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.000
<i>Oh, welcome.</i>

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:53.300
<i>Cat,</i>

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:55.410
<i>are you alone?</i>

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.000
<i>Do you want to come with me?</i>

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.670
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.290
<i>No, I couldn't!</i>

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:02.850
<i>My bloodline is undistinguished, 
I talk funny,</i>

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:03.880
<i>and I'm just a mutt...</i>

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.340
<i>Perfect.</i>

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:10.500
<i>I was just searching for 
a familiar without vanity.</i>

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:13.020
<i>Let us form a contract.</i>

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.350
<i>Identify yourself.</i>

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:23.550
Rurumo appeared outta nowhere and took me in.

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.040
I see...

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:27.990
Well, enough about me.

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:30.960
Listen, the rain is yer enemy.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.390
It'll make ya sick,

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:35.470
so don't let it get ya wet.

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:37.580
Are those the kittens?

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:39.160
They're cute.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:41.050
Can we hold them?

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.300
Y-Yeah, sure.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.530
They're so cute.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.090
They're so tiny.

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:52.260
Women really are weak when it 
comes to animals and children.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.410
Perfect timing.

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.560
I'm actually looking for new homes for them...

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.590
They need homes?

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:00.720
I'll ask my mom.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:01.440
Me, too.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:02.570
That'd be great.

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:06.240
They say nobody who likes animals can be bad.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:09.470
Shibaki-senpai might actually be a good person.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:13.650
<i>Does this mean...</i>

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:16.200
<i>I'll finally get</i>

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.820
<i>what I've always longed for?!</i>

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:24.960
<b>These stick parts here.</b>

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:24.960
<b>I made
 'em all 
myself!</b>

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:24.960
<b>HMPH!</b>

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.960
Yes, yes, yes!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:30.070
Heaven is on my side!

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.930
Let's do this!

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:33.680
Look, kittens!

00:14:34.050 --> 00:14:35.430
How cute!

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:37.180
Let me see!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:40.120
They're so cute!

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.650
<i>I've always wanted to try this...</i>

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.780
<i>Walk around school with 
a bunch of girls in tow!</i>

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:48.570
No pets allowed in the school building!

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:50.310
You wanna hold them?

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:51.320
What? Really?

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:54.160
I mean, no pets allowed in the school—

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.830
Let me see, too!

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.790
<i>They're touching me!</i>

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.310
Yahoo!

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:12.970
You're actually a nice person, 
Shibaki-san the pervert.

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:17.840
<i>Oh, man. I've definitely gone 
up at least two stages!</i>

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:19.430
Lucky him.

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:20.890
Yeah.

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:26.860
He's an idiot.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:32.550
Thanks to you guys, my dream finally came true.

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:33.840
I know it's the same as always,

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:36.440
but I give you this formula with my gratitude.

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:37.700
Drink up.

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:40.350
What's wrong, Case?

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:41.540
Are ya sleepy?

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:44.690
Let me know anytime you get hungry.

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:50.270
It's not fair that you're 
getting all the girls, Shiba.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:51.420
Let us borrow them.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:54.520
You wanna be popular that badly?

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.050
You guys are hopeless.

00:15:58.110 --> 00:15:59.810
So this is the power of cats.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.810
I understand why it makes you 
so popular with the girls.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:05.060
So, have you found anyone to take them?

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.360
Not yet...

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:08.190
But I'm the one who found them.

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:10.760
I've gotta find homes for them.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.930
They're so cute.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.180
Case, huh?

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.470
<i>This concludes the news.</i>

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:25.460
You're from Tanako-chan's class?

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:29.590
Thanks for helping me find homes for them.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:30.500
<i>Next up is the weather report.</i>

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:30.990
Later.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:34.620
<i>The rain from this afternoon 
has let up in most areas,</i>

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:37.100
I'll be sad when you're gone,

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:38.350
<i>but if you plan to head out later this evening,</i>

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:41.420
but it's great that you found a home, huh, Case?

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.560
<i>you may need an umbrella.</i>

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:46.020
<i>The weather will remain unsettled until dawn.</i>

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.300
<i>Rain clouds have suddenly formed,</i>

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:50.480
<b>Heavy Rain and Flood Warning</b>

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.480
<i>and all regions are experiencing rain.</i>

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:00.700
Guys!

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.790
Sorry. You must've been cold.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.060
You're all soaked...

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.130
Okay, let's go.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:24.100
His mom's fast asleep. Now's our chance.

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:27.060
I brought them.

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:28.950
We're all ready here.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:41.660
Who's going to look after them 
if you catch a cold?

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:44.780
It's just for today.

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:50.240
Mom...

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:13.690
<i>What's happening?</i>

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:16.810
<i>They were full of energy until yesterday...</i>

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:18.570
Hey!

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:19.760
Answer me!

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:22.500
Man! Slaughter! Case!

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:35.410
<i>If only I had noticed sooner...</i>

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.240
<i>No.</i>

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:39.590
<i>I put them through too much.</i>

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:42.960
<i>I'm an idiot. I got ahead of myself.</i>

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:46.680
Hang in there! We're almost 
to the animal hospital!

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.800
You're awake, Case?

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:55.780
Hey!

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.640
Where are you going?

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:04.200
<b>You</b>

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:04.200
<b>Dropped</b>

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.200
<b>This</b>

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.790
Case!

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.510
Hang in there, Case!

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.920
Don't just lie there!

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.100
Wake up!

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:22.260
Magic, activate!

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.220
I need healing magic, Rurumo!

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:29.170
Damn it!

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:32.100
Why aren't they burning like they always do?

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:32.940
Is it because of the rain?

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.690
It's not the rain.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.480
Rurumo! Thank goodness!

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:39.320
I can't use my tickets.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.900
There's nothing wrong with the tickets.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:43.830
Then why won't they work?

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.620
We need to hurry, or there'll 
be nothing to joke about!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.470
If we take too long, Case will—

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:52.080
Case was born weak.

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:56.340
This was his fate.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.550
What are you talking about?

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.050
Hurry up and use your healing magic!

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:02.510
Magic...

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:05.850
doesn't work on the dead.

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:10.430
What?

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.600
Those are the rules.

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:25.780
He looks happy.

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:28.480
If you hadn't taken him in,

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.750
he would have died long ago.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.760
It's good that you did.

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:38.000
I'm sure Case was happy to have met you.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.020
Case...

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:55.940
Bury him with your own hands.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:11.560
<b>Later, 
Man 
and 
Slaughter</b>

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:12.520
<i>Later, Man and Slaughter</i>

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:15.540
<b>were adopted 
by girls 
who like cats.</b>

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:15.650
<i>were adopted by girls who like cats.</i>

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:49.720
Case

00:23:21.670 --> 00:23:25.420
Summer! Beaches! Swimsuits!

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:27.150
What are swimsuits?

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:28.340
Are they yummy?

00:23:28.790 --> 00:23:31.220
The next episode is "Legendary Swimsuit."

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Next Episode: Legendary Swimsuit</b>

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:32.890
You're in a good mood.
